# Storefront (client) — local env
# Copy to client/.env and restart Vite (`pnpm dev:client`).

# Google Maps JavaScript API key (Places API New — Place Autocomplete).
# Enable APIs: Maps JavaScript API + Places API (New).
# Application restriction: HTTP referrers (websites) — NOT IP addresses.
#   http://localhost:5173/*
#   https://your-production-domain/*
# IP restrictions only work for server-side keys; browser Places calls will 403.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
